OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland needs 'courage
OL,4,Aand leadership' to tackle climate
OL,5,Achange
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Courage and leadership" are needed to
OL,8,Fensure Northern Ireland catches up on
OL,9,Ftackling climate change.
OL,11,FThe new chair of the Climate Change
OL,12,FCommittee, Nigel Topping, is spending
OL,13,Ftwo days on a fact-finding mission to
OL,14,Fhear the thoughts of people across
OL,15,Fdifferent sectors.
OL,17,FHe said Northern Ireland was a small
OL,18,Fnation that could be "agile and
OL,19,Finnovative" in tackling challenges like
OL,20,Fincreasing renewable energy, improving
OL,21,Fwaste management and reducing
OL,22,Femissions.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
