OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland needs 'courage
OL,4,Aand leadership' to tackle climate
OL,5,Achange
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut he warned that a failure to act
OL,8,Fwould mean missing out on innovation
OL,9,Fopportunities, paying more for energy
OL,10,Fand damaging the health of children.
